From: Honmani <noreply@honmani.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Import books other readers forgive

One missing font, an encoded or wrongly cased reference or a blank page
refused the whole book; contents entries and pictures were matched by
parts of their names. References are resolved to the files in the zip,
what is missing is skipped, and broken CSS no longer keeps a book shut.

